      "created_at": "2018-09-29T02:58:40.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I mostly play physical sentinels at a weekly game night and usually there is 5 to 10 minutes of walking involved, never enough parking. &nbsp;While carrying the full case might work the fisrt few times has anyone found a good strap, or other way to hlep carry the case that works for travel? &nbsp;Just got my tracking for the kickstarted so if the case is easier to manage also let me know.</p>",
